WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.351
F5.3 · A Google Sheet that loads itself

2
00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:11.323
Some data is kept by people, in a spreadsheet: the budget, a forecast, the FX rates.

3
00:00:11.373 --> 00:00:15.113
Keep it there. K-φ reads the sheet, and never writes to it.

4
00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:18.572
Name each tab after what it holds.

5
00:00:18.622 --> 00:00:22.826
The columns are the contract's fields, listed on the developers page.

6
00:00:27.263 --> 00:00:31.152
Share the sheet by link, then paste the link into the sheet assistant.

7
00:00:31.202 --> 00:00:33.547
It shows each tab and what it becomes.

8
00:00:36.263 --> 00:00:39.847
Tick: load into K-φ each time the sheet changes.

9
00:00:39.897 --> 00:00:47.337
A row that fails is named with its tab, its line and its field, and nothing of that tab is stored until it passes.

10
00:00:48.787 --> 00:00:52.357
Next: F5.4  An API key and Postman

